<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS3" title="In Appendix F Discussion ‣ Imagine for Me: Creative Conceptual Blending of Real Images and Text via Blended Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.3 </span>Societal Impact</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
