<li id="Ax2.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Ax2.I1.i4.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Ax2.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">D.2: Qualitative Observation Report (SD) <span id="Ax2.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#A4.SS2" title="D.2 Qualitative Observation Report (SD) ‣ Appendix D Additional Baseline Comparisons ‣ Imagine for Me: Creative Conceptual Blending of Real Images and Text via Blended Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.2</span></a>

<br class="ltx_break">(A limitation of training-free inversion-based method)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix E: Additional Results and Analysis</p>
<ul id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
