<p id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">E.1: Effect of <math id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> of Blended Attention <span id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#A5.SS1" title="E.1 Effect of 𝛼 of Blended Attention ‣ Appendix E Additional Results and Analysis ‣ Imagine for Me: Creative Conceptual Blending of Real Images and Text via Blended Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.1</span></a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">E.2: Softmax Temperature Control (heuristic for multiple reference images)</p>
