<li id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">E.3: Additional Results <span id="Ax2.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#A5.SS3" title="E.3 Additional Results ‣ Appendix E Additional Results and Analysis ‣ Imagine for Me: Creative Conceptual Blending of Real Images and Text via Blended Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
