<p id="Ax2.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix F: Discussion <span id="Ax2.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Discussion ‣ Imagine for Me: Creative Conceptual Blending of Real Images and Text via Blended Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a></p>
<ul id="Ax2.I1.i6.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax2.I1.i6.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Ax2.I1.i6.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Ax2.I1.i6.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax2.I1.i6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">F.1: Interesting Future Directions</p>
</div></li>
